 ## Operating characteristics
 
-*   **Time Complexity**: The method involves casting rays through a volume, sampling cells, and integrating along the path. Complexity depends on the number of rays, samples per cell, and the depth of the volume traversal. Early termination helps reduce time for opaque regions [S1].
